. **Divide 144 by 4**:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{144}{4} = 36\n\\]\n\n7. **Finalize the area**:\n\n\\[\n\\text{Area} = 36 \\sqrt{3}\n\\]\n\nThus, the area of the equilateral triangle is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{36\\sqrt{3}}\n\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{36\\sqrt{3}}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"prealgebra:661"}
